    "model": "Nike SB Dunk Low",
    "gender": "men",
    "description": "The Nike Dunk SB Low Fog is a skateboarding sneaker that slightly resembles the Nike Dunk SB High Fog released in 2005. Designed to provide individuals with the comfort they need while skateboarding, this sneaker features a black suede upper contrasted with a gray leather Nike Swoosh logo on its side and a grey Nike SB branding on its heel. It also features a mesh tongue, black laces, a dark midsole, a black rubber sole, and a gum rubber outsole.\n<br>\n<br>\nThe Nike Dunk SB Low Fog was released in 2021. Originally, it had a retail price of $100.",
